Package: edahelper
Type: Package
Title: Mass creates summary plots and tables for datasets
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Daniel", "Aybar",
      email = "daniel_aybar@brown.edu",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Creates multiple descriptive boxplots, barplots, scatterplots, and grouped tables for datasets with one function. Users will have the option to work with ggplot2 or base r graphics, as well as the ability to subset the data and customize plot features.
